@todoId = 44e0d6a7-410e-415e-bba4-48aaf1db78e3
### 1. Create a todo
POST http://localhost:3000/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write API documentation",
  "description": "Test the Todo API"
}
### 2. Get one todo by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/{{todoId}}
### 3. Update the todo state
PUT http://localhost:3000/todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "doing"
}

### 4. List all todos
GET http://localhost:3000/todos

### 5. List only doing todos
GET http://localhost:3000/todos?state=doing

### 6. Check that the updated task is no longer in the todo state
GET http://localhost:3000/todos?state=todo

### 7. Delete the todo
DELETE http://localhost:3000/todos/{{todoId}}
### 8. Check that the deleted todo is gone
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/{{todoId}}

### 9. Reject an invalid state
POST http://localhost:3000/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test invalid state",
  "state": "finished"
}

### 10. Reject malformed JSON
POST http://localhost:3000/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test broken JSON",
}

### 11. Reject an invalid state when updating
PUT http://localhost:3000/todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "finished"
}

### 12. Reject an invalid state filter
GET http://localhost:3000/todos?state=finished

